{"name": "Solnox - Grimoire of Seasons", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are the last force standing between the encroaching Last Season and what remains of this world. Build your perfect deck, master synergies, and fight back against the encroaching Last Season. Choose your Warden and channel their unique rune stone deck to stand against unholy creatures threatening the last remnants of the world. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/3bcc2c71af7ab0d800a4afe14d1832ee.poster.avif?t=1784131817\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/3bcc2c71af7ab0d800a4afe14d1832ee.webm?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras_big/991e1a6c7549eaf3f604e425c1c1aa8d.avif?t=1784131817\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/991e1a6c7549eaf3f604e425c1c1aa8d.avif?t=1784131817\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/b9c7c6bffd92d9e902baa15385256d33.poster.avif?t=1784131817\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/b9c7c6bffd92d9e902baa15385256d33.webm?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/b9c7c6bffd92d9e902baa15385256d33.mp4?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter - each season carries its own distinct power, capable of shaping the battlefield in unique ways. Use seasonal runes to manipulate terrain, boost abilities, and weaken enemies, while creating devastating synergies. But beware\u2014the Last Season is relentless, and your foes already consumed by it wield their own devastating abilities to ensure your downfall. Adapt, strategize, and save what remains of the dying world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras_big/67b36d9d64d2f6df6824480dd7dd93d1.avif?t=1784131817\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/67b36d9d64d2f6df6824480dd7dd93d1.avif?t=1784131817\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/8820b9599f019eaa98df79e6b7d02906.poster.avif?t=1784131817\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/8820b9599f019eaa98df79e6b7d02906.webm?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/8820b9599f019eaa98df79e6b7d02906.mp4?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The land of Ecendael was once a thriving nation, safeguarded by the Wardens of Change. That was, until \u00a0Morrigan the Unfading, once a Warden herself, betrayed the order and unleashed the Last Season\u2014a plague of stagnation that drains life, warps minds, and spreads unstoppable corruption. Armed with the last remnants of seasonal magic, the surviving Wardens must reclaim their lost power and push back against the corruption that has ravaged their land. Each Warden brings a unique approach to battle, shaping the fight from the very first card played.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras_big/1814b30d0f374fa4494534378dfdcb1f.avif?t=1784131817\" height=\"140\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/1814b30d0f374fa4494534378dfdcb1f.avif?t=1784131817\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/ed28ccf9c3f94c7ff0f0ceab0b9216df.poster.avif?t=1784131817\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/ed28ccf9c3f94c7ff0f0ceab0b9216df.webm?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/ed28ccf9c3f94c7ff0f0ceab0b9216df.mp4?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The Wardens are the last force standing between corruption and survival. You can choose between three of them, each tied to two unique starting decks with different playstyles. Experiment with different strategies, refine your deck as you progress, and discover powerful new synergies with each run. With every failed attempt, you\u2019ll grow stronger, unlocking new decks and gaining access to even more potent and complex runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/597ede2ac374cf12d7931c48eaae106a.poster.avif?t=1784131817\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/extras/597ede2ac374cf12d7931c48eaae106a.webm?t=1784131817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Wield the power of the seasons to push back corruption and take back nature from tainted enemy hordes. Manipulate the ever-changing battlefield with your deck of rune stones. Plan your turns and use powerful synergies to your advantage. Choose your path wisely and unlock new classes as you prevail.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1993570/225bdaef774581dd5642c4772707d2d425004c33/header.jpg?t=1784131817", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Game", "Deckbuilding", "Turn-Based Combat", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Roguelite", "Strategy"], "developers": "ByteRockers' Games", "publishers": "ByteRockers' Games", "release_date": "Jul 15, 2026", "price": "$6.66", "appid": "1993570", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "8 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/X_omTImfI04", "first_seen": 1746662400.0, "review_rank": 1689}